# Confetti Physics — development hygiene

## 1. Strict typing, no `any`

- Never introduce `any`. Define precise interfaces/types in `src/types.ts`.
- Public API types are exported from `src/index.ts`.

## 2. Physics stays in `src/physics/`

- All physics math (gravity, drag, wobble, spawn, integrate) lives in `src/physics/**` as pure functions.
- `src/render/**` must not contain physics formulas inline.
- `src/dom/**` handles DOM lifecycle only.

## 3. No magic numbers

- Extract constants to `src/constants.ts`.

## 4. Resource cleanup

- Every `requestAnimationFrame` paired with `cancelAnimationFrame`.
- Every `ResizeObserver` disconnected on destroy.
- Guard `window`, `document`, `requestAnimationFrame` for SSR.

## 5. Component size / SRP

- Keep files focused. Extract helpers rather than growing mega-files.
